1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:06,266
Welcome to Echo Loom. This walkthrough uses sample AI responses and prepared portrait assets.

2
00:00:06,266 --> 00:00:20,235
Start with a few words about someone you would like to meet.

3
00:00:20,235 --> 00:00:25,489
A structured profile keeps appearance, personality, and speaking style editable.

4
00:00:25,489 --> 00:00:30,623
Make a small change. The same character identity is preserved.

5
00:00:30,623 --> 00:00:42,417
Generate a portrait from the appearance profile, then preview the result before selecting it.

6
00:00:42,417 --> 00:01:00,133
Edit the selected portrait with a simple instruction. The original image stays available.

7
00:01:00,133 --> 00:01:06,491
Compare saved versions and switch back at any time, without recreating the character.

8
00:01:06,491 --> 00:01:28,405
Chat with the saved character. Their latest profile guides the conversation.

9
00:01:28,405 --> 00:01:32,975
Ready for a shared scene? The activity button is always visible.

10
00:01:32,975 --> 00:01:41,724
Describe the scene, your relationship, and anything you want to avoid.

11
00:01:41,724 --> 00:01:48,991
Your invitation becomes a scene card in this conversation.

12
00:01:48,991 --> 00:01:58,465
Story mode presents narration, character dialogue, and AI-assisted player lines.

13
00:01:58,465 --> 00:02:03,332
Read at your own pace: step through, play, pause, or show the whole segment.

14
00:02:03,332 --> 00:02:11,487
Important decisions are yours. Choose an intention or write your own response.

15
00:02:11,487 --> 00:02:19,423
The next scene responds to your choice while keeping the character consistent.

16
00:02:19,423 --> 00:02:26,433
Return to chat anytime. The scene card keeps your story ready to continue.

17
00:02:26,433 --> 00:02:31,467
Create once. Keep shaping the character — and pick up where you left off.
